OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fwindy this evening with some
OL,7,Fparticularly strong and gusty westerly
OL,8,Fwinds over higher ground. The
OL,9,Fpossibility of a shower but some late
OL,10,Fsunny spells for most. Winds easing
OL,11,Fovernight and turning cooler with the
OL,12,Fodd shower remaining possible.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAny showers fading away
OL,15,Fthrough the morning, leaving an
OL,16,Fincreasingly dry day with sunny
OL,17,Fperiods. Still a little breezy but
OL,18,Fmuch less windy than on Friday. Warm
OL,19,Fin the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
