OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSome
OL,6,Frain possible on Sunday morning,
OL,7,Fprobably much brighter and warmer
OL,8,Flater but rather windy. Largely dry
OL,9,Fand cloudy on Monday, windier on
OL,10,FTuesday with rain or showers possible.
